extends layout

block content
  h3 Hi #{name},

  p Welcome to Yifu. Your account has been successfully created.

  p Below are your login details:

  table(style="margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:10px")
    tr
      td(style="padding:5px 0; font-weight:bold") Email:
      td(style="padding:5px 0") #{email}
    tr
      td(style="padding:5px 0; font-weight:bold") Password:
      td(style="padding:5px 0") #{password}

  p For security reasons, we strongly recommend that you change your password after logging in for the first time.

  p If you did not request this account, please contact our support team immediately.

  p Thanks,
  p Team Yifu
